  "_comment": "Home page hero: the SRv6 fabric that src/diagrams/hero.jsx builds act by act, and that hooks/diagrams.py renders as the static first frame. Node x/y are centres in scene units. uSID F3216: block fc00:0::/32 for algo 0, fc00:80::/32 for Flex-Algo 128, one 16-bit uSID per node. flex: links in the algo-128 plane. mrc: links that exist only in the AI act. bar: scene units kept free at the bottom for the caption bar.",
